    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys"><head>ΠΡΩΤΕΥΣ</head>
          <pb n="605" facs="urn:hathi:iau.31858007086675:scan:613"/>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="194" xml:id="frag_584b6262a3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.nauck1889-grc1:210">
            <note type="source">Athenaeus IX. p. 394 a.</note>
            <note type="source">Φάψ—Αἰσχύλου ἐν τῷ τραγικῷ (i. q. σατυρικῷ) Πρωτεῖ οὕτω μνημονεύοντος τοῦ ὄρνιθος</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_584b6262a3-l1" xml:lang="grc">Σιτουμένην δύστηνον ἀθλίαν φάβα,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="frag_584b6262a3-l2" xml:lang="grc">μέσακτα πλευρὰ πρὸς πτύοις πεπλεγμένην.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="195" xml:id="frag_789d5c6d33" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.nauck1889-grc1:211">
            <note type="source">Herodianus περὶ μονήρους λέξεως p. 35, 19.</note>
            <note type="source">Γάρος Αἰσχύλος Πρωτεῖ σατυρικῷ “Καὶ τὸν ἰχθύων γάρον.” Omisso nomine fabulae affertur ab Athenaeo II. p. 67 c. Conf. Herodianum Piersoni p. 437.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="196" xml:id="frag_17e28ed77d" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Homeri Odyss. δ, 366.</note>
            <note type="source">Εἰδοθέη: ἀπὸ τῆς εἰδήσεως καὶ ἐπιστήμης τοῦ πατρὸς τὸ ὄνομα. καὶ Αἰσχύλος δὲ ἐν Πρωτεῖ Εἰδοθέαν αὐτὴν καλεῖ. Etymolog. Gudian. p. 316, 30. ex codice Parisino 2638. correctum, Κερδώ: ὑποκοριστικῶς, ὡς παρ' Αἰσχύλῳ ἡ Εἰδὼ καὶ Ὑψὼ ἀντὶ τοῦ Εἰδοθέα καὶ Ὑψιπύλη. Conf. Bekkeri Anecd. II. p. 857, 9.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="197" xml:id="frag_467a0eefd5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.nauck1889-grc1:213">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄελπτοι: δεινοὶ καὶ ἄαπτοι. Αἰσχύλος Πρωτεῖ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="198" xml:id="frag_6394d58a46" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.nauck1889-grc1:214">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄμαλα: τὴν ναῦν, ἀπὸ τοῦ ἀμᾶν τὴν ἅλα. Αἰσχύλος Πρωτεῖ σατυρικῷ. Corrupte Etymolog. M. p. 75, 22. Ἁμάδα τὴν ναῦν Αἰσχύλος.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="199" xml:id="frag_60443170b0" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:proteys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.proteys.nauck1889-grc1:215">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐπάσω: ἐκτήσω. Αἰσχύλος Πρωτεῖ σατυρικῷ.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text>
